#: model:ir.model.fields,help:b10_products.field_product_margin_classification__profit_margin
msgid ""
"Also called 'Net margin' or 'Net Profit Ratio'.\n"
"It is computed with the following formula Profit Margin = 100 * (Sale Price - Cost) / Sale Price"
msgstr ""
"També anomenat 'marge net' o 'ràtio de benefici net'.\n"
"Es calcula amb la fórmula següent Marge de benefici = 100 * (Preu de venda - Cost) / Preu de venda"

